  - idle_timeout
  - turn_limit_reached
  - cost_limit_reached
  - admin_terminate
  - duration_limit_reached
idempotency: SESSION_CLOSE_ACK guarantees single close per sessionId — duplicate SESSION_CLOSE frames coalesced
